.TH AVR\-VM\-ROTATE\-HTTPS\-LABEL 1 "" "avr 0.8.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-vm-rotate-https-label \- Replace public HTTPS URLs to invalidate leaked URLs.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr vm rotate-https-label
[OPTIONS] VM_ID_OR_NAME
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace public HTTPS URLs to invalidate leaked URLs.
.PP
Routes change once ingress applies the rotation. On a running VM, AVREA_SANDBOX_URL (in new login shells) and /vm/info follow within seconds; a paused VM picks up the new URLs at resume.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIVM_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the updated VM as JSON.
